{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "46c471733a751ac85d6b788fca4f861b6b39951ecdb74703d3c456eed81077ff", "ja": "アート＆アダルティ", "zh": "艺术与成熟魅惑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3dd49b0570ce7be6919d471c051254800efedd6f87984aac30e50f8b2dc13b43", "ja": "衣装とさり気ない工夫で、\nセクシーさをアップ！\nPV撮影の本番までクオリティアップに\n余念がないアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "借助服装与巧妙的小心思，\n魅力值大幅提升！\n这是偶像们在MV拍摄正式开始前\n仍不忘精益求精的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1fc57293452fb6640f5f4f3c6b1c940917bdc1e272f4d91179cebb7713da3bf6", "ja": "（もうすぐ、PV撮影の本番が始まる。\nこのみさんとロコ、そろそろ準備できた頃かな？）", "zh": "（PV拍摄正式录制马上就要开始了。木实小姐和ROCO应该也差不多准备好了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "edae494889e845c2bd455e51628e8b9a99a57016728e1c720b11bd4f79e24253", "ja": "こっちにもつけて……はい、これで完成！\nどうかしら？　さりげない感じでしょ？", "zh": "这边也装上……好了，这样就完成了！怎么样？看起来很自然吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "d8295f28ec20e8875039dd74d293c7e4173ff32418ebec5de97dceb099cb00f9", "ja": "むむむ……とってもエクセレントです、コノミ！\nこんなアプローチがあるなんて……アメイジングです！", "zh": "唔唔唔……太excellent了，konomi！\n竟然还有这种approach……简直amazing！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "d1bfef3dc69ba6089717aec8e1e6e35a99736c2889ba519eed9a8719d28b19d6", "ja": "ふふっ♪　気に入ってもらえてよかったわ……あら？\n{$P$}？　いつからそこに……", "zh": "呵呵♪你喜欢就好……咦？\n{$P$}？你什么时候来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3e0aee7451b1dc534700b30275392761d15e842c5e23450b16dd0d0a951faaad", "ja": "っと、ごめんなさい！　声を掛けるタイミングが\nなくて……ふたりを呼びに来たんです。", "zh": "啊，抱歉！一直没找到合适的时机跟你们打招呼……我是来叫你们两位的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "346fc9d0a67a24da6626e127ed727deaade4323805085ea4bcd9f2b3c12b20e1", "ja": "{$P$}、見てください！\nこのマーベラスな衣装とアダルティなスタイルを！", "zh": "{$P$}，请看！\n这身绝妙的服装，还有成熟的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "44edfdcad7dc3c9aaf7c55482df8b353453bf75e048b6fc57c5d39eee7251a7d", "ja": "うん、本当に似合ってると思う。\nふたりとも、アーティスティックな感じで……。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得真的很适合你们。\n两个人都很有艺术气息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "430177551faae8a4d311fa6ce173709cb78469c2b69334f74b679f9bef837422", "ja": "まあ、ありがとう！　でも……ウフフ♪\nそれだけかしら？　他に何か、気づかない……？", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢！不过……呵呵♪  \n就这些吗？还有没有注意到别的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3a7ee37feadd2ad0d089f83362708956919367a54bf5cfb88bbaa975ee17bf70", "ja": "え？　何かって……ええと？", "zh": "咦？你说什么……呃……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "79f33dcb978f252ccdda5f61b8639a9b57b1954dccf91f2cd7e947125bd5e6ed", "ja": "ヒントはバイブスです！　よーくチェックしてみて\nください。いきますよ、ふわっ、ふわっ……♪", "zh": "提示就在感觉！请仔细观察一下。要开始咯，飘啊，飘啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d22ea5f891a764e1746b9ee0d79443c2a1204c53fafa4830c7716a0817b05b4a", "ja": "（なんだ？　あのフワフワした動き……。\n柔軟剤を変えた、とか？　いや、絶対違うな……）", "zh": "（那是什么？那种轻飘飘的动作……\n难道是换了柔顺剂之类的？不，绝对不可能……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "eeb91a4a7ec9abdf39f9c50b186b69053aee94dfea5b834b3f9bcdcf778db86f", "ja": "もう、{$P$}ったら！\nレディの変化に気づけないなんて、ダメじゃない。", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}！\n居然没能察觉到淑女的变化，这样可不行哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "405bc5600c2d90c8f64354c57dafaeb8ade0f7a04073cff1242c869c9d6d1a86", "ja": "答えは香りよ、香り。大人っぽくて妖艶な感じの\nPVに合わせて、ふんわり漂わせてみたの。", "zh": "答案是香味哦，香味。配合那种成熟又妖艳风格的PV，我让香气轻轻地飘散开来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "718ab0099afe8c5d97479cb7c920a2f73e10e3a6b88909bc9c80c7c042709d43", "ja": "コノミが選んでくれたフレグランスは、\nロコをインサイドからセクシーにしてくれるんですよ♪", "zh": "木实选的香水，能让ROCO从内而外变得性感哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "df6e4ce31bfc6ab705ddcfcf1c87d112ea18f7ba9b13eb6a52dea644eb3e232e", "ja": "ああ、香り、なるほど……。\nすみません、そっちは意識してませんでした。", "zh": "啊，原来是香味……明白了。\n抱歉，我没注意到这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "7966220ffc613adf81868dbcf9cdc0f4209a78a0439bd557f42dfaa33e411ecd", "ja": "まだまだね、{$P$}♪　\nまあ本当に薄くだから、無理もないんだけど。", "zh": "你还嫩着呢，{$P$}♪\n不过香味真的很淡，注意不到也难怪啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "81b829d95401f039b4f7aba403bfebd933f2550d479a0bd60498302c8a813c65", "ja": "テクニックは隠してこそ、アトラクティブに\nエクスプレッションできるものですよ！", "zh": "技巧正是要藏起来，才能更有魅力地表现出来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "615e2649a837c899cbb1ebf6d2eaf030c70912eff9c3741a79348e8c4366db2d", "ja": "それはアートも同じです。アンダースタンドより\nフィーリングが大事な時だってあるんです。", "zh": "艺术也是如此。有时候，比起理解，\n感觉更重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "50f45a739ea2a8863e2e15486419abe3e04de22167fcf37001d30fc59db18a6a", "ja": "なるほど？　つまり……\n私たちは今、芸術的にセクシーってことよね？", "zh": "原来如此？也就是说……\n我们现在是艺术感十足的性感，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "08487da9868dfbdfc43340af32332aeba54af7475e1df66332387570eea50189", "ja": "イグザクトリーです！　{$P$}も、\nフィーリングはキャッチできてるはず。ですよね？", "zh": "完全正确！{$P$}也一定已经捕捉到这种感觉了。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0ce2a841349b8c65550da570c7bec3e0bb9e61f4a3f78aeba56f2f49773f658c", "ja": "あ、ああ……キャッチできてる！\n衣装にメイク、それに香水……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……我感受到了！\n服装、妆容，还有香水……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1a1156516f189cc99d2897ddc8e484b7963f459331bf29ff90e0ff8f852dd1b0", "ja": "ふたりの工夫のおかげで、\n最大限に魅力が引き出されていると思うよ！", "zh": "多亏你们两个人的巧思，我觉得她的魅力被最大限度地展现出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "f4fbc48b10be85a1869809240b70f6ca73d40aca18938275e11a39b8dd46535e", "ja": "ウフフ♪　ありがとう！　そこまでメロメロに\nなってくれたなら、作戦成功だわ。", "zh": "呵呵♪谢谢！既然已经被迷得神魂颠倒了，看来我们的作战成功了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "14920efce0cac18a91dae386cff682fae62a34fd9d331f897c3446032842ae2e", "ja": "それじゃ、そろそろね……{$P$}。\n今日は一瞬だって、私たちから目を離しちゃダメよ！", "zh": "那么，差不多该开始了……{$P$}。今天哪怕一瞬间，也不许把视线从我们身上移开哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "d20302d266f2d39da67a62985c9a501dde6fa6910c3d104d1d68459d0576ac1e", "ja": "ロコとコノミのクリエイティブなコラボレーション、\nしっかり目に焼き付けてくださいね！", "zh": "请务必将ROCO和木实这场充满创意的合作，深深印刻在眼中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "9039adb2678cd940f2f60cf81d890933c6c735cbdde0d76b051febc855295e1b", "ja": "もちろん、最後まで見届けさせてもらうよ。\nふたりの魅力を、存分に見せつけてきてくれ！", "zh": "当然，我会好好看到最后的。\n把你们两个人的魅力，尽情展现出来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_116_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_116_fc_01_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "2df36b34dd6bcf9447ba44fd19651899046ba39c1d862a1ce50616abc6f726a3", "ja": "ええ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
